1
00:00:01,757 --> 00:00:04,197
August, summer break.

2
00:00:04,757 --> 00:00:06,215
Even so...

3
00:00:06,298 --> 00:00:08,091
(Summer Break: Study Room Open)

4
00:00:12,937 --> 00:00:16,017
With college exams ahead,
we're having a serious study group.

5
00:00:18,018 --> 00:00:19,269
Serious...

6
00:00:20,045 --> 00:00:21,371
- Ow...
- Shh!

7
00:00:22,477 --> 00:00:23,777
Focus on studying.

8
00:00:25,197 --> 00:00:26,497
Okay.

9
00:00:28,017 --> 00:00:29,822
Still, though...

10
00:00:29,905 --> 00:00:31,632
Studying is important and all,

11
00:00:32,757 --> 00:00:34,837
but this is our last summer
of high school.

12
00:00:37,017 --> 00:00:38,998
Are we really okay spending it like this?

13
00:00:39,081 --> 00:00:40,416
- No.
- Of course not.

14
00:00:40,499 --> 00:00:41,694
- Yeah.
- Not okay.

15
00:00:41,777 --> 00:00:43,377
What are we even doing here?

16
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:48,715
Our last summer of high school...

17
00:00:50,357 --> 00:00:53,053
Oh, Morisaki, you finally showed up.

18
00:00:53,136 --> 00:00:54,154
You're so late.

19
00:00:54,237 --> 00:00:56,077
Naturally, I slept in until just now.

20
00:00:59,217 --> 00:01:00,978
Wait, where's Watarai?

21
00:01:02,396 --> 00:01:06,316
He's watching the house with Tsumugi,
so he's studying at home.

22
00:01:06,817 --> 00:01:08,314
I see.

23
00:01:08,397 --> 00:01:12,574
Come to think of it, I haven't seen him
since summer break started.

24
00:01:12,657 --> 00:01:14,274
Same here, same here.

25
00:01:14,357 --> 00:01:15,614
What's up with Watarai?

26
00:01:15,697 --> 00:01:17,114
Is he super busy?

27
00:01:17,197 --> 00:01:18,674
He has to study,

28
00:01:18,757 --> 00:01:20,677
and it sounds like
he has a lot of chores, too...

29
00:01:21,037 --> 00:01:23,254
I haven't seen him either.

30
00:01:23,337 --> 00:01:24,694
Huh?

31
00:01:24,777 --> 00:01:26,077
Really?

32
00:01:26,677 --> 00:01:29,994
We talk on the phone every day, though.
Things are going great.

33
00:01:30,077 --> 00:01:32,157
Does that thing not bother you anymore?

34
00:01:32,717 --> 00:01:34,417
You know, about Watarai...

35
00:01:36,477 --> 00:01:38,174
Well, it was pretty ridiculous.

36
00:01:38,257 --> 00:01:40,997
We're dating, and yet I
know nothing about you.

37
00:01:42,561 --> 00:01:43,645
Yeah.

38
00:01:44,857 --> 00:01:48,474
Besides, there's no rush.
I can take my time getting to know him.

39
00:01:48,557 --> 00:01:51,557
Watarai and I are going
to the same college, after all.

40
00:01:54,357 --> 00:01:55,616
Right.

41
00:01:55,699 --> 00:01:57,374
Even after we graduate,

42
00:01:57,457 --> 00:01:59,177
you two will still see each other
every day.

43
00:02:03,337 --> 00:02:05,077
Oh, right...

44
00:02:05,937 --> 00:02:07,237
Oh.

45
00:02:07,777 --> 00:02:09,313
Sorry.

46
00:02:09,396 --> 00:02:10,274
Let me take this.

47
00:02:10,357 --> 00:02:11,674
Wait, is it Watarai?

48
00:02:11,757 --> 00:02:13,057
Who's calling?

49
00:02:14,009 --> 00:02:15,761
- Who's calling?
- Watarai.

50
00:02:16,345 --> 00:02:17,930
Definitely Watarai.

51
00:02:18,013 --> 00:02:19,693
- Look at that huge grin on his face.
- Seriously.

52
00:02:19,717 --> 00:02:20,254
Sorry.

53
00:02:20,337 --> 00:02:21,774
Are you free to talk right now?

54
00:02:21,857 --> 00:02:22,574
Yeah.

55
00:02:22,657 --> 00:02:23,657
Is something wrong?

56
00:02:23,717 --> 00:02:25,374
No, nothing.

57
00:02:25,457 --> 00:02:26,794
I just...

58
00:02:26,877 --> 00:02:28,577
suddenly wanted to see your face, Hioki.

59
00:02:30,497 --> 00:02:32,997
I missed you too, so I'm really glad.

60
00:02:33,997 --> 00:02:35,614
By the way,

61
00:02:35,697 --> 00:02:37,294
I'm sorry

62
00:02:37,377 --> 00:02:39,213
I haven't had much time for you
over summer break.

63
00:02:39,237 --> 00:02:40,534
No, it's totally fine.

64
00:02:40,617 --> 00:02:42,417
We'll see each other again
once school starts.

65
00:02:42,457 --> 00:02:46,357
And we'll have even more
time together in college.

66
00:02:53,017 --> 00:02:53,754
Um, well...

67
00:02:53,837 --> 00:02:56,034
Sorry to interrupt!

68
00:02:56,117 --> 00:02:58,037
Long time no see, Watarai.

69
00:02:58,557 --> 00:03:01,657
Hate to interrupt your lovey-dovey chat,
but got a sec?

70
00:03:02,497 --> 00:03:03,497
What's up?

71
00:03:03,537 --> 00:03:05,757
Watarai, what days are you free
this break?

72
00:03:06,537 --> 00:03:07,314
Huh?

73
00:03:07,397 --> 00:03:12,735
We were just talking with Morisaki
about going glamping.

74
00:03:12,818 --> 00:03:14,054
Huh? Glamping?

75
00:03:14,137 --> 00:03:15,437
Wait...

76
00:03:16,157 --> 00:03:17,157
Doesn't that mean...

77
00:03:17,217 --> 00:03:18,897
we're all staying overnight together?

78
00:03:19,537 --> 00:03:20,614
What do you say?

79
00:03:20,697 --> 00:03:21,834
Not interested?

80
00:03:21,917 --> 00:03:24,337
A two-day, one-night
summer glamping trip.

81
00:03:24,837 --> 00:03:26,774
Hioki's included.

82
00:03:26,857 --> 00:03:28,617
Hold on, this is the first
I'm hearing of it!

83
00:03:28,677 --> 00:03:29,394
Huh?

84
00:03:29,477 --> 00:03:30,669
You're coming, right, Hioki?

85
00:03:30,752 --> 00:03:32,894
A trip with Hioki...

86
00:03:32,977 --> 00:03:35,594
Oh, well, if Watarai...

87
00:03:35,677 --> 00:03:37,377
Glamping...

88
00:03:38,477 --> 00:03:39,674
All right.

89
00:03:39,757 --> 00:03:42,037
No pressure if you're busy.

90
00:03:43,417 --> 00:03:45,974
We can always just take Hioki with us.

91
00:03:46,057 --> 00:03:47,574
What'll it be?

92
00:03:47,657 --> 00:03:48,957
What'll it be?

93
00:03:49,457 --> 00:03:51,057
So, what's the verdict?

94
00:03:56,757 --> 00:03:58,314
I'm going.

95
00:03:58,397 --> 00:04:01,414
There's no way I'm letting Hioki
go without me.

96
00:04:01,497 --> 00:04:02,434
Awesome!

97
00:04:02,517 --> 00:04:03,234
Then it's settled!

98
00:04:03,317 --> 00:04:04,114
Let's do this!

99
00:04:04,197 --> 00:04:09,708
Glamping, glamping, glamping...

100
00:04:13,057 --> 00:04:14,737
And just like that,

101
00:04:15,297 --> 00:04:18,057
our last summer of high school
was about to begin!

102
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:19,100
School Trip: Joined a Group
I'm Not Close to Season2.

103
00:05:20,500 --> 00:05:24,800
(Episode 6: Our Last Summer Break)

104
00:05:31,697 --> 00:05:33,657
Maybe I got here a little too early.

105
00:05:37,917 --> 00:05:39,006
Hioki...

106
00:05:39,089 --> 00:05:40,465
Asahi-kun?

107
00:05:44,970 --> 00:05:46,263
Ryoto!

108
00:05:47,973 --> 00:05:49,414
Asahi!

109
00:05:49,497 --> 00:05:51,617
Long time no see! Whoa.

110
00:05:53,937 --> 00:05:55,874
No hugging.

111
00:05:55,957 --> 00:05:57,257
Because he's mine.

112
00:06:00,017 --> 00:06:01,434
You haven't changed a bit, Tsukasa.

113
00:06:01,517 --> 00:06:03,857
Yep. Long time no see.

114
00:06:04,797 --> 00:06:07,493
Man, those two are all over each other
first thing in the morning.

115
00:06:07,576 --> 00:06:08,618
Hey, Ryoto.

116
00:06:09,244 --> 00:06:09,674
Hey!

117
00:06:09,757 --> 00:06:11,094
Haru-chan, how've you been?

118
00:06:11,177 --> 00:06:12,034
Pretty good.

119
00:06:12,117 --> 00:06:13,714
Long time no see, Ryoto.

120
00:06:13,797 --> 00:06:15,234
Hioki, it's been a while.

121
00:06:15,317 --> 00:06:16,917
Yeah, it really has.

122
00:06:19,457 --> 00:06:21,256
Wait, where's your bag?

123
00:06:21,339 --> 00:06:23,454
Oh, right here.

124
00:06:23,537 --> 00:06:24,274
I'll carry it for you.

125
00:06:24,357 --> 00:06:25,174
Thanks.

126
00:06:25,257 --> 00:06:26,557
- Ready to go?
- Yeah.

127
00:06:37,337 --> 00:06:38,106
Hmm?

128
00:06:38,189 --> 00:06:40,997
Nothing. I'm just really happy
to finally see you.

129
00:06:42,986 --> 00:06:44,379
Come on.

130
00:06:44,997 --> 00:06:46,297
How can you be so cute?

131
00:06:51,369 --> 00:06:52,754
Ahem!

132
00:06:52,837 --> 00:06:55,334
No flirting over there, you two!

133
00:06:55,417 --> 00:06:59,134
Oh, my bad.
I only had eyes for Hioki just now.

134
00:06:59,217 --> 00:07:00,314
When do you ever not?

135
00:07:00,397 --> 00:07:01,697
Hurry up and get in!

136
00:07:05,157 --> 00:07:06,457
Oh...

137
00:07:08,929 --> 00:07:10,854
There, all set.

138
00:07:10,937 --> 00:07:11,714
Thanks.

139
00:07:11,797 --> 00:07:12,797
Yeah.

140
00:07:20,017 --> 00:07:22,374
All righty, let's hit the road!

141
00:07:23,517 --> 00:07:25,057
First up,

142
00:07:25,657 --> 00:07:27,037
our very first stop is...

143
00:07:27,864 --> 00:07:28,949
Hit it.

144
00:07:32,285 --> 00:07:34,621
Here we are, here we are!

145
00:07:34,704 --> 00:07:36,274
What should we ride first?

146
00:07:36,357 --> 00:07:37,657
Hey, what do you wanna go on?

147
00:07:40,137 --> 00:07:41,137
An amusement park, huh?

148
00:07:41,197 --> 00:07:42,413
We haven't been to one
since the school trip.

149
00:07:42,437 --> 00:07:43,154
Yeah.

150
00:07:43,237 --> 00:07:44,817
I'm glad we get to come together again.

151
00:07:45,777 --> 00:07:47,193
There they go being all lovey-dovey again.

152
00:07:47,217 --> 00:07:47,994
Who cares?

153
00:07:48,077 --> 00:07:49,314
We're not at school.

154
00:07:49,397 --> 00:07:51,357
Let them be as lovey-dovey
as they want today.

155
00:07:52,137 --> 00:07:54,817
Don't mind if we do, then.

156
00:07:56,857 --> 00:07:58,394
Hey, hurry up over there!

157
00:07:58,477 --> 00:07:59,294
Come on!

158
00:07:59,377 --> 00:08:00,094
Move it!

159
00:08:00,177 --> 00:08:01,673
There's no line right now!
Now's our chance!

160
00:08:01,697 --> 00:08:02,997
Let's go!

161
00:08:04,157 --> 00:08:05,527
What do you think of the weather?

162
00:08:06,417 --> 00:08:07,134
Hmm...

163
00:08:07,217 --> 00:08:08,094
Oh, get over here, quick!

164
00:08:08,177 --> 00:08:09,774
Get in place over there.

165
00:08:09,857 --> 00:08:10,754
All right, squeeze in!

166
00:08:10,837 --> 00:08:11,854
Get set.

167
00:08:11,937 --> 00:08:12,734
Taking it now!

168
00:08:12,817 --> 00:08:14,837
Say mozzarella cheese!

169
00:08:37,497 --> 00:08:39,234
Quit using your brother as a human shield.

170
00:08:39,317 --> 00:08:40,395
You caught me?

171
00:08:42,817 --> 00:08:44,374
Don't worry, I'm right here.

172
00:08:44,457 --> 00:08:46,057
You can hold on even tighter
if you want.

173
00:08:46,317 --> 00:08:47,736
It's fine.

174
00:08:54,492 --> 00:08:55,661
You sure?

175
00:08:55,744 --> 00:08:57,114
Wait, hold on, there's more?

176
00:08:57,197 --> 00:08:59,594
- No, no, no, I seriously can't!
- Come on!

177
00:08:59,677 --> 00:09:01,217
Next group, step right in.

178
00:09:07,257 --> 00:09:08,557
Huh?

179
00:09:09,537 --> 00:09:11,218
- Oh!
- Whoa...

180
00:09:11,301 --> 00:09:13,294
Are you okay? Sorry about that...

181
00:09:15,077 --> 00:09:16,737
This is way too extreme.

182
00:09:20,877 --> 00:09:21,594
Yeah.

183
00:09:21,677 --> 00:09:23,194
I think I'm gonna pass.

184
00:09:23,277 --> 00:09:24,577
You'll be fine!

185
00:09:25,817 --> 00:09:27,717
Wait, Hioki, are you
sure you're up for this?

186
00:09:28,677 --> 00:09:30,317
Yeah, I'm fine.

187
00:09:31,029 --> 00:09:33,174
You don't look fine at all.

188
00:09:33,257 --> 00:09:34,494
Really, I'm good.

189
00:09:34,577 --> 00:09:36,214
Don't push yourself.

190
00:09:36,297 --> 00:09:37,657
Want to sit this one out together?

191
00:09:38,917 --> 00:09:41,274
I can sit it out on my own.
You go ahead and ride, Watarai.

192
00:09:41,357 --> 00:09:42,833
I'm not leaving you alone.

193
00:09:42,916 --> 00:09:43,916
I'm coming with you.

194
00:09:43,997 --> 00:09:45,054
But...

195
00:09:45,137 --> 00:09:46,494
All right, all right.

196
00:09:46,577 --> 00:09:48,497
You two are way too sweet.
I can't watch anymore.

197
00:09:48,897 --> 00:09:49,714
Just go already.

198
00:09:49,797 --> 00:09:52,757
While you're at it,
go check out something else together.

199
00:09:53,337 --> 00:09:54,074
Yeah.

200
00:09:54,157 --> 00:09:55,254
We'll do that, then.

201
00:09:55,337 --> 00:09:56,054
Thanks.

202
00:09:56,137 --> 00:09:56,974
Catch you guys later.

203
00:09:57,057 --> 00:09:58,414
Have fun!

204
00:09:58,497 --> 00:09:59,554
See you later.

205
00:09:59,637 --> 00:10:00,937
See ya.

206
00:10:02,727 --> 00:10:04,234
- Welp, I'm bailing too.
- Hey, Ryoto!

207
00:10:04,317 --> 00:10:05,605
- Hold up!
- Ryoto!

208
00:10:08,066 --> 00:10:08,954
Hold him tight.

209
00:10:09,037 --> 00:10:09,735
Got him.

210
00:10:09,818 --> 00:10:10,997
Target secured!

211
00:10:11,637 --> 00:10:12,514
Nice.

212
00:10:12,597 --> 00:10:14,274
Is this really necessary, guys?

213
00:10:14,357 --> 00:10:15,032
Keep it down, please.

214
00:10:15,115 --> 00:10:17,235
Whoa, it's like the safety bar
is already locked down.

215
00:10:17,277 --> 00:10:17,994
Have mercy on me.

216
00:10:18,077 --> 00:10:19,233
Is it really safe to ride like this?

217
00:10:19,257 --> 00:10:21,257
What about you, Watarai?
Anything you want to ride?

218
00:10:21,637 --> 00:10:24,583
Let's see...

219
00:10:24,666 --> 00:10:26,417
- Hioki! Hioki!
- Well...

220
00:10:27,137 --> 00:10:28,437
- Asahi!
- Come this way.

221
00:10:42,397 --> 00:10:44,097
Hioki, are you okay?

222
00:10:44,686 --> 00:10:46,134
Wh-What do you mean?

223
00:10:46,217 --> 00:10:48,848
Nothing, you just seem super tense.

224
00:10:49,897 --> 00:10:53,114
Oh, are you afraid of heights?

225
00:10:53,197 --> 00:10:55,074
No, heights don't bother me.

226
00:10:55,157 --> 00:10:56,597
Besides, I like looking at the view.

227
00:10:57,617 --> 00:10:58,917
It's just...

228
00:11:01,697 --> 00:11:04,757
it's been so long
since the two of us were alone like this.

229
00:11:05,317 --> 00:11:06,617
I'm a little...

230
00:11:10,257 --> 00:11:11,557
Heart racing?

231
00:11:35,111 --> 00:11:35,994
Hmm?

232
00:11:36,077 --> 00:11:37,374
Oh, sorry.

233
00:11:37,457 --> 00:11:39,597
You just looked way too cute
waiting for it.

234
00:11:41,367 --> 00:11:42,994
Wha—.

235
00:11:43,077 --> 00:11:44,174
Forget it, I'm done.

236
00:11:44,257 --> 00:11:45,314
I'm sorry!

237
00:11:45,397 --> 00:11:45,994
One more try.

238
00:11:46,077 --> 00:11:46,794
No way.

239
00:11:46,877 --> 00:11:48,277
Come on, please? Just one more try.

240
00:11:48,791 --> 00:11:50,014
- No.
- Are you embarrassed?

241
00:11:50,097 --> 00:11:51,397
That's so cute.

242
00:11:52,377 --> 00:11:54,437
Hey, let me see your face again.

243
00:11:59,437 --> 00:12:01,997
Stop it, I seriously can't take this.

244
00:12:02,837 --> 00:12:03,774
I'm sorry.

245
00:12:03,857 --> 00:12:05,474
Did you hate it that much?

246
00:12:05,557 --> 00:12:07,617
No, that's not it! It's just me.

247
00:12:09,357 --> 00:12:11,917
My heart's been in overdrive all day.

248
00:12:13,597 --> 00:12:17,577
We only spent a little time apart,
and somehow you got even cooler.

249
00:12:21,577 --> 00:12:24,377
I like you way too much right now.
I don't know what to do with myself.

250
00:12:28,117 --> 00:12:29,417
What's wrong with that?

251
00:12:34,128 --> 00:12:36,057
I like you way more anyway.

252
00:12:39,634 --> 00:12:41,127
I'm not losing when it comes to that.

253
00:12:43,685 --> 00:12:44,985
So cute.

254
00:12:49,811 --> 00:12:53,037
Seriously, though...
are we gonna be okay like this?

255
00:12:55,108 --> 00:12:58,794
I'm so happy, people will figure us out
right away at college.

256
00:12:58,877 --> 00:13:00,114
Oh.

257
00:13:00,197 --> 00:13:02,057
Better start practicing my poker face.

258
00:13:13,257 --> 00:13:14,557
Hioki...

259
00:13:16,857 --> 00:13:18,157
Listen...

260
00:13:24,037 --> 00:13:25,294
Look at this.

261
00:13:25,377 --> 00:13:28,017
(Hotta: Ryoto looks completely dead lol)
Ryoto's face is priceless.

262
00:13:30,537 --> 00:13:32,177
His eyes rolled into the back
of his head.

263
00:13:43,237 --> 00:13:46,326
The sky cleared up!

264
00:13:49,757 --> 00:13:51,374
Ryoto, which one is ours?

265
00:13:51,457 --> 00:13:53,041
- This one?
- A little further down.

266
00:13:53,124 --> 00:13:54,714
I like this one better.

267
00:13:54,797 --> 00:13:57,694
- Forget that one, ours is even better!
- Hurry up, come on!

268
00:13:57,777 --> 00:14:00,173
After I went through all the trouble
of booking it...

269
00:14:02,665 --> 00:14:03,834
Huh?

270
00:14:03,917 --> 00:14:05,217
Whoa!

271
00:14:06,077 --> 00:14:07,077
It's huge!

272
00:14:08,277 --> 00:14:09,294
This is awesome!

273
00:14:09,377 --> 00:14:10,274
Amazing.

274
00:14:10,357 --> 00:14:11,677
Nice job, Ryoto.

275
00:14:14,317 --> 00:14:15,734
Hmm?

276
00:14:15,817 --> 00:14:16,957
Wait, aren't we short on beds?

277
00:14:16,981 --> 00:14:20,314
Oh, you noticed?

278
00:14:20,397 --> 00:14:23,517
We're all close anyway,
so we'll figure it out!

279
00:14:24,297 --> 00:14:25,917
Sloppy planning as usual.

280
00:14:26,697 --> 00:14:27,414
Yep.

281
00:14:27,497 --> 00:14:28,214
What's that?

282
00:14:28,297 --> 00:14:29,894
Anyway,

283
00:14:29,977 --> 00:14:32,157
Hioki and Watarai can just share a bed,
right?

284
00:14:34,377 --> 00:14:36,734
Ooh, blushing?

285
00:14:36,817 --> 00:14:38,334
Oh my.

286
00:14:38,417 --> 00:14:39,634
Asahi-chan,

287
00:14:39,717 --> 00:14:40,894
you're blushing, aren't you?

288
00:14:40,977 --> 00:14:43,634
Knock it off.

289
00:14:43,717 --> 00:14:45,017
Getting shy?

290
00:15:04,529 --> 00:15:07,023
- Come on, keep moving.
- Okay.

291
00:15:13,162 --> 00:15:14,972
So, how's it going?

292
00:15:16,397 --> 00:15:17,314
Huh?

293
00:15:17,397 --> 00:15:18,454
Come on,

294
00:15:18,537 --> 00:15:20,044
I mean, you know...

295
00:15:21,177 --> 00:15:23,073
How have things been
with you and Tsukasa lately, huh?

296
00:15:23,097 --> 00:15:24,497
Why do you sound like a dad?

297
00:15:26,177 --> 00:15:27,957
Hey, a guy gets curious!

298
00:15:29,337 --> 00:15:30,337
Well? Huh?

299
00:15:30,397 --> 00:15:31,994
For starters,

300
00:15:32,077 --> 00:15:33,683
are you two officially dating? Huh?

301
00:15:34,537 --> 00:15:35,254
Yes.

302
00:15:35,337 --> 00:15:36,514
We're dating.

303
00:15:36,597 --> 00:15:37,957
Since near the end of junior year.

304
00:15:40,677 --> 00:15:42,377
So about five months now, huh?

305
00:15:45,097 --> 00:15:46,654
So...

306
00:15:46,737 --> 00:15:48,037
are you happy?

307
00:15:51,057 --> 00:15:52,357
Yes.

308
00:15:54,078 --> 00:15:55,372
I see, I see.

309
00:15:55,455 --> 00:15:57,434
That's great, then. Yeah.

310
00:15:57,517 --> 00:15:59,254
Puts your old man's mind at ease.

311
00:15:59,337 --> 00:16:00,054
Yep.

312
00:16:00,137 --> 00:16:01,437
- Old man?
- Yep.

313
00:16:08,217 --> 00:16:09,217
Watarai.

314
00:16:09,917 --> 00:16:11,314
Did something happen?

315
00:16:11,397 --> 00:16:12,314
Huh?

316
00:16:12,397 --> 00:16:13,697
It's about Hioki, right?

317
00:16:16,392 --> 00:16:18,917
He's the only thing
ever on your mind anyway.

318
00:16:22,064 --> 00:16:23,354
Well...

319
00:16:23,437 --> 00:16:24,737
kind of...

320
00:16:26,597 --> 00:16:28,034
Hmm?

321
00:16:28,117 --> 00:16:29,417
What's going on?

322
00:16:39,582 --> 00:16:40,875
Actually...

323
00:16:41,834 --> 00:16:42,960
I...

324
00:16:47,757 --> 00:16:49,025
- What?!
- Shh!

325
00:16:53,397 --> 00:16:54,697
Why?

326
00:16:56,157 --> 00:16:57,457
Well, because...

327
00:16:58,745 --> 00:17:00,045
So...

328
00:17:00,997 --> 00:17:02,397
how far have you two gone?

329
00:17:03,877 --> 00:17:04,994
Huh?

330
00:17:05,077 --> 00:17:07,036
Oh, you know... um...

331
00:17:09,256 --> 00:17:11,030
- All the—
- What?!

332
00:17:11,113 --> 00:17:12,406
What are you asking?!

333
00:17:17,736 --> 00:17:19,077
Sorry, sorry!

334
00:17:20,477 --> 00:17:24,177
If there's anything you don't know
about that stuff, you can ask me anytime.

335
00:17:25,236 --> 00:17:26,702
I-I won't!

336
00:17:26,785 --> 00:17:28,005
Too cute.

337
00:17:28,798 --> 00:17:30,154
What?

338
00:17:30,237 --> 00:17:31,537
For a reason like that?

339
00:17:32,937 --> 00:17:34,154
Does Hioki

340
00:17:34,237 --> 00:17:35,894
know about this?

341
00:17:35,977 --> 00:17:38,437
Not yet. I'm going to tell him myself.

342
00:17:38,937 --> 00:17:40,357
Keep it from Hioki for now.

343
00:17:45,737 --> 00:17:48,318
You're gonna cross that line
someday anyway.

344
00:17:48,401 --> 00:17:49,734
Got it?

345
00:17:49,817 --> 00:17:52,197
Just picture it in your head.

346
00:17:55,457 --> 00:17:57,076
Way too carefree.

347
00:17:57,159 --> 00:17:59,439
Don't be so uptight.
We have the whole place to ourselves.

348
00:18:02,117 --> 00:18:04,277
Look at those two.

349
00:18:05,209 --> 00:18:07,637
- Getting along as great as ever.
- Are you okay?

350
00:18:13,537 --> 00:18:16,637
Hey, quit being all lovey-dovey
in the bath, too!

351
00:18:17,137 --> 00:18:18,814
Wait, not right now.

352
00:18:18,897 --> 00:18:20,197
Why not?

353
00:18:23,353 --> 00:18:24,653
No reason...

354
00:18:43,581 --> 00:18:46,250
Why am I getting so flustered?

355
00:18:50,197 --> 00:18:51,654
Hioki,

356
00:18:51,737 --> 00:18:53,675
can I sit...

357
00:18:53,758 --> 00:18:55,251
a little closer?

358
00:18:56,510 --> 00:18:57,510
O-Oh, sure...

359
00:19:13,077 --> 00:19:14,314
Oh man.

360
00:19:14,397 --> 00:19:16,157
I'm still way too nervous.

361
00:19:19,659 --> 00:19:20,951
Hioki.

362
00:19:23,297 --> 00:19:24,597
Um...

363
00:19:25,117 --> 00:19:27,625
Say... doesn't it...

364
00:19:28,250 --> 00:19:29,543
Actually...

365
00:19:32,380 --> 00:19:33,673
I...

366
00:19:35,737 --> 00:19:37,137
Sorry, Watarai.

367
00:19:38,617 --> 00:19:39,917
I think...

368
00:19:40,596 --> 00:19:42,154
Hioki?

369
00:19:42,237 --> 00:19:44,277
I stayed in too long
and got dizzy...

370
00:19:47,017 --> 00:19:48,037
Hioki!

371
00:19:51,517 --> 00:19:53,214
I'm sorry.

372
00:19:53,297 --> 00:19:55,477
No, don't worry about it.

373
00:19:58,537 --> 00:20:00,897
Kind of brings back memories, doesn't it?

374
00:20:02,097 --> 00:20:03,097
Huh?

375
00:20:03,536 --> 00:20:04,704
From back...

376
00:20:04,787 --> 00:20:06,080
at the beach.

377
00:20:06,757 --> 00:20:08,249
Oh, wait, that cup has—.

378
00:20:09,557 --> 00:20:10,857
That's straight-up alcohol.

379
00:20:11,957 --> 00:20:13,257
Back then,

380
00:20:14,004 --> 00:20:16,215
I caused you trouble too, Watarai.

381
00:20:16,799 --> 00:20:18,175
It wasn't trouble at all.

382
00:20:19,051 --> 00:20:21,095
Clingy Hioki is cute, too.

383
00:20:24,137 --> 00:20:25,437
Honestly...

384
00:20:26,117 --> 00:20:27,817
You're way too sweet to me, Watarai.

385
00:20:29,277 --> 00:20:31,257
Only to you, Hioki.

386
00:20:38,217 --> 00:20:39,534
I really do feel so at ease

387
00:20:39,617 --> 00:20:40,917
whenever I'm with you, Watarai.

388
00:20:56,717 --> 00:20:57,914
Thank you.

389
00:20:57,997 --> 00:20:59,550
I think...

390
00:20:59,633 --> 00:21:00,968
I'm fine now.

391
00:21:04,597 --> 00:21:05,890
Ready to head back?

392
00:21:10,577 --> 00:21:11,854
Hmm?

393
00:21:11,937 --> 00:21:13,237
Hioki,

394
00:21:16,677 --> 00:21:17,977
do you remember what I told you

395
00:21:19,737 --> 00:21:21,397
at the beach that day?

396
00:21:23,199 --> 00:21:26,886
If you spoil me too much,
I'll turn hopeless.

397
00:21:32,497 --> 00:21:33,857
Turn hopeless, then. I don't mind.

398
00:21:35,937 --> 00:21:37,933
I'll take care of you
for the rest of my life, Hioki.

399
00:21:37,957 --> 00:21:39,215
Come on.

400
00:21:39,298 --> 00:21:40,633
What are you even saying?

401
00:21:42,097 --> 00:21:43,737
I'll cherish you for the rest of my life.

402
00:21:47,397 --> 00:21:49,257
When I said I'd take care of you forever...

403
00:21:52,837 --> 00:21:54,137
Everything I said back then,

404
00:21:55,537 --> 00:21:56,837
I meant every word of it.

405
00:21:59,417 --> 00:22:01,077
No matter what happens from now on,

406
00:22:02,737 --> 00:22:04,897
I'll always be by your
side to support you, Hioki.

407
00:22:08,577 --> 00:22:10,397
Did something happen?

408
00:22:21,048 --> 00:22:22,341
Actually...

409
00:22:23,657 --> 00:22:25,957
There's something I have to tell you.

410
00:22:30,850 --> 00:22:32,142
I...

411
00:22:34,520 --> 00:22:35,913
I can't go with you, Hioki...

412
00:22:40,137 --> 00:22:42,197
I can't go to the same
university as you, Hioki.

413
00:22:50,177 --> 00:22:52,138
(Next Episode Preview) Even
though we can still meet if we want to,

414
00:22:52,162 --> 00:22:54,253
(High school life is coming to an end...)
taking seeing each other like this for granted

415
00:22:54,277 --> 00:22:55,793
is probably only going
to last a little longer...

416
00:22:55,817 --> 00:22:57,834
Watarai, see you tomorrow.

417
00:22:57,917 --> 00:23:01,517
(Things I don't know despite being together...)
What is it that Watarai really wants to do?

418
00:23:02,097 --> 00:23:04,457
I don't know anything about Watarai at all.

419
00:23:05,677 --> 00:23:08,414
If you're the one asking,
it'll definitely be fine.

420
00:23:08,497 --> 00:23:09,594
Come on, please.

421
00:23:09,677 --> 00:23:10,776
Won't you?
